Subject: [PATCH] feat(nemotron_h): add layers_to_capture hook to NemotronHModel

Nemotron 3 has no per-layer activation capture, so the engine refuses to start
it with --enable-return-hidden-states. Adds the same hook gemma4.py, llama.py
and qwen3.py already carry.

NemotronHModel accumulates aux_hidden_states for layers in layers_to_capture
and returns them second; NemotronHForCausalLM gates on
capture_aux_hidden_states and forwards them to the logits processor.

Uses the None-residual form. The stack carries residual separately, and it's
None on layer 0, which EAGLE3 never captures but the hidden-states flag does.

Depends on #877 for the flag and the output reshape, and on the model patch
for the file.
 python/sgl_jax/srt/models/nemotron_h.py | 39 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++------
 1 file changed, 32 insertions(+), 7 deletions(-)

diff --git a/python/sgl_jax/srt/models/nemotron_h.py b/python/sgl_jax/srt/models/nemotron_h.py
index 1dcaf33c..7055db89 100644
